The following code is easier to read and reproduces the issue:

```
typedef struct {
  double f64 __attribute__((__vector_size__(8*sizeof(double))));
} simde__m512d_private;

void test_simde_x_mm512_round_pd(simde__m512d_private in, simde__m512d_private * out) {
  for (int i = 0; i < sizeof(out->f64[0]); i++)
    out->f64[i] = __builtin_roundeven(in.f64[i]);
}
```

Built with: `clang -O2 -mcpu=power8`

Link to Compiler Explorer: https://godbolt.org/z/aKv8f38Pj

